    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/8632d9385c86ebee64dfeb63a026377a.avif?t=1750849908\" /></div><br><br><strong>Welcome to ZENOS Stadium!</strong><br>Are you ready for the ultimate online stadium experience? ZENOS Stadium is a free online experience that redefines how we watch and experience live online esports competitions. We're bringing fans closer together with proximity voice chat, custom stadium experiences and unlimited possibilities of interactions!<br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/fff6ab9be973baea0512b39c3b3f9359.avif?t=1750849908\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/23cf6950c0152b752eb65f834b7fd2ff.poster.avif?t=1750849908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/23cf6950c0152b752eb65f834b7fd2ff.webm?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/23cf6950c0152b752eb65f834b7fd2ff.mp4?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join thousands of other fans in a full 3D world dedicated to esports competitions in the new virtual home of esports!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/5cbd1ffc11cac2aaf218a5c6680a0005.avif?t=1750849908\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/aab0bd042886b0035f64019d8b81b3e7.poster.avif?t=1750849908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/aab0bd042886b0035f64019d8b81b3e7.webm?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/aab0bd042886b0035f64019d8b81b3e7.mp4?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Share your passion with other esports fans. Chat with anyone around you through spatial audio voice comms, interact with them and cheer for your favorite team with special props and consumables!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/70488f6ab12f24597dfdbb6eabc53e96.avif?t=1750849908\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/9f73b49a278337ea420e2710af69b449.poster.avif?t=1750849908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/9f73b49a278337ea420e2710af69b449.webm?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/9f73b49a278337ea420e2710af69b449.mp4?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Create and customise your own avatar with Ready Player Me. Rep your favourite esports teams or simply rock your own style in the stadium!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/e3112d9facf843bbdb0ab411f3aea7bc.avif?t=1750849908\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/5e28e365297bb4df60ee300d76fe52ca.poster.avif?t=1750849908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/5e28e365297bb4df60ee300d76fe52ca.webm?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1690050/extras/5e28e365297bb4df60ee300d76fe52ca.mp4?t=1750849908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With Skybox3D technology, live Counter-Strike games are fully recreated in real time, right in the middle of the stadium. Watch the match from any angle, and follow your favourite players in the heat of the action!",
